$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag Air";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Sky World" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Partly Cloudly" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Midday" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> battle each other with their massive flying bases. The bases are located high above the planet surface , if you fall then you will drop to your death. Win by scoring 8 points, you can do this by capturing the flag and holding the central base . May the best team win!" @
	 "\n\n<f1>Map By:<f4> Lisa W.  (XGN LadyShar) Pick up all the Xtreme Gaming map packs at www.xtremegaming.net";